WEBVTT

00:55:56.271 --> 00:56:00.406
was such an incredible
experience to have of love.

00:56:01.089 --> 00:56:02.541
But with her gone,

00:56:02.565 --> 00:56:06.363
to be very honest, there are things I
could do that I couldn't have done before.

00:56:06.387 --> 00:56:08.921
And people feel guilty about saying that

00:56:08.945 --> 00:56:10.963
because they feel like it's disloyal

00:56:10.987 --> 00:56:12.622
or that it's criminal to say that,

00:56:12.646 --> 00:56:15.761
that this person wanted to live
and wanted to do these things.

00:56:15.785 --> 00:56:18.795
But what I'm exploring now is,

00:56:18.819 --> 00:56:20.949
OK, these are the new terms.

00:56:20.973 --> 00:56:23.826
The person I loved more
than anyone in the entire world,

00:56:23.850 --> 00:56:27.894
the one person in the world
I always said I cannot live without,

00:56:27.918 --> 00:56:29.211
is gone.

00:56:29.235 --> 00:56:33.798
So what does that leave me
in terms of what I now get to be?